        "procedure": "Prepared as for complex 1, replacing the Eu salt with Gd(NO3)3·6H2O (0.23 g, 0.5 mmol). Colorless crystals formed after 3 days; too small/weakly diffracting for a complete X-ray data set. Crystals were filtered, washed with cold MeOH (2 × 2 mL) and Et2O (2 × 3 mL), and dried in air. The air-dried solid analyzed as 2·2MeOH.",
